+---
+id: thm-adhm-fixed-point-instanton-count
+kind: theorem
+title: "ADHM Fixed Points and the Equivariant Instanton Count"
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+dependency_level: 5
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+deps:
+  - def-framed-u-n-instanton-moduli-and-adhm-data
