+---
+id: def-framed-u-n-instanton-moduli-and-adhm-data
+kind: definition
+title: "Framed U(N) Instanton Moduli and ADHM Data"
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+dependency_level: 3
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+axiom_base: "ZF + full AC, inherited from the supplied Chern-class definition."
+deps:
